{
  "id": "qud-algebra",
  "title": {
    "en": "Algebra Essentials",
    "ar": "أساسيات الجبر"
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Linear equations, simple systems, expansion and substitution — the algebra that the quantitative section relies on.",
          "ar": "المعادلات الخطية، الأنظمة البسيطة، الفك والتعويض — الجبر الذي يعتمد عليه القسم الكمّي."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Working with unknowns",
          "ar": "▲ مرجع — التعامل مع المجاهيل"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Solve a linear equation by isolating the variable. A system of two equations can be solved by elimination or substitution. Expand \\( (x+a)(x+b)=x^2+(a+b)x+ab \\).",
          "ar": "لحل معادلة خطية، اعزل المتغيّر. يمكن حل نظام من معادلتين بالحذف أو بالتعويض. افرد \\( (x+a)(x+b)=x^2+(a+b)x+ab \\)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Linear",
              "ar": "خطية"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( ax+b=c \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Expand",
              "ar": "الفك"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (x+a)(x+b) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "System",
              "ar": "النظام"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "eliminate or substitute",
              "ar": "حذف أو تعويض"
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Powers",
              "ar": "الأسس"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a^{m}a^{n}=a^{m+n} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 3.A",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 3.أ"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Solve \\( 2x+5=17 \\). \\[ 2x=12,\\qquad x=6. \\]",
          "ar": "حلّ \\( 2x+5=17 \\). \\[ 2x=12,\\qquad x=6. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 3.B",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 3.ب"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "If \\( x+y=10 \\) and \\( x-y=4 \\), find \\( x \\). Add the equations: \\( 2x=14 \\). \\[ x=7. \\]",
          "ar": "إذا كان \\( x+y=10 \\) و\\( x-y=4 \\)، أوجد \\( x \\). بجمع المعادلتين: \\( 2x=14 \\). \\[ x=7. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": "سؤال تدريبي"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Solve: \\(2x+y=11\\) and \\(x-y=1.\\) <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>Add: \\(3x=12\\Rightarrow x=4.\\) <p>\\(4-y=1\\Rightarrow y=3.\\)</p></div></details>",
          "ar": "حلّ: \\(2x+y=11\\) و\\(x-y=1.\\) <details><summary>عرض الحل</summary><div>بالجمع: \\(3x=12\\Rightarrow x=4.\\) <p>\\(4-y=1\\Rightarrow y=3.\\)</p></div></details>"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "chapterNumber": "3"
}
